{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02484",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 4.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.81,
      "end_seconds": 8.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.52,
      "end_seconds": 11.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "it's being very breathless, mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.95,
      "end_seconds": 16.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.8,
      "end_seconds": 32.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Alright, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.96,
      "end_seconds": 57.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 22, pressure 125 over 89, pulse 85. And temperature is 36.9 degrees. Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.29,
      "end_seconds": 61.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I've had it for three days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.72,
      "end_seconds": 76.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.35,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.02,
      "end_seconds": 95.79,
      "duration_seconds": 17.77,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, I get some relief from sitting up. Lying flat definitely sets it off. As for sweating, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.53,
      "end_seconds": 100.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "a few quick ones: calf pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.31,
      "end_seconds": 105.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.17,
      "end_seconds": 109.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Nothing like wheeze?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.25,
      "end_seconds": 112.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "no, none, no wheeze"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.4,
      "end_seconds": 117.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.28,
      "end_seconds": 122.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.97,
      "end_seconds": 128.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.97,
      "end_seconds": 132.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.78,
      "end_seconds": 136.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.48,
      "end_seconds": 144.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.67,
      "end_seconds": 148.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.58,
      "end_seconds": 159.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "Mm, uh, it's furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning. Though honestly, some days I forget to take it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.13,
      "end_seconds": 178.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.4,
      "end_seconds": 183.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Yes, heart failure. I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.38,
      "end_seconds": 191.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.11,
      "end_seconds": 204.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.62,
      "end_seconds": 225.33,
      "duration_seconds": 19.71,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I only drink at family occasions. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I swim twice a week. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.64,
      "end_seconds": 230.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.51,
      "end_seconds": 234.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.06,
      "end_seconds": 251.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "There are crackles all the way up both lungs and and you are breathing very fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.17,
      "end_seconds": 259.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.82,
      "end_seconds": 303.76,
      "duration_seconds": 34.94,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, it points towards acute pulmonary oedema. It could also be a severe chest infection, so we'll keep that open. An ECG is what I'd like next, for pulmonary oedema. The The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I think a chest X-ray makes sense here, for pulmonary oedema. Sit upright, I am giving oxygen and a water tablet injection now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.72,
      "end_seconds": 310.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "We'll refer you to to the emergency team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.35,
      "end_seconds": 313.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.91,
      "end_seconds": 332.59,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "let's hold off on blood tests for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it i'd like you back straight away i think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.41,
      "end_seconds": 336.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.41,
      "end_seconds": 338.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}